Cloud Shell, which

00:30:20.950 --> 00:30:23.320
will automate those steps
that I've walked through

00:30:23.320 --> 00:30:24.470
on the command line.

00:30:24.470 --> 00:30:27.190
And so this just provides
a nice, easy way for you

00:30:27.190 --> 00:30:31.000
to learn about using these
different methods for building

00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:35.080
Docker containers and
deploying them up on Cloud Run.

00:30:35.080 --> 00:30:38.080
So it's clone dot git repo
and checked out the branch

00:30:38.080 --> 00:30:40.360
that we were on,
and then it's asking

00:30:40.360 --> 00:30:41.720
