00:30:41.720 --> 00:30:43.177
I'm saying jw demo.

00:30:43.177 --> 00:30:44.260
Where do I want to deploy?

00:30:44.260 --> 00:30:48.640
US central one is the region,
and now what it will do

00:30:48.640 --> 00:30:53.440
is run that Maven jib
task on this repo.

00:30:53.440 --> 00:30:56.740
So that's now running and
creating our container image

00:30:56.740 --> 00:31:00.040
using jib, storing
that container image up

00:31:00.040 --> 00:31:02.680
on the Google
container registry.

00:31:02.680 --> 00:31:03.680
So there you go.

00:31:03.680 --> 00:31:06.690
You see that it's doing that
Maven package jib build,

00:31:06.690 --> 00:31:08.260
